---
// OWNER REVIEW REQUIRED before launch: confirm legal entity name and any trading terms.
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { business } from '../config/site';
---
<LegalLayout title="Terms of Use" heading="Terms of use" path="/terms/" description="Terms governing the use of the Neovantis website by healthcare professionals and institutional buyers.">
  <p>These terms apply to your use of this website, operated by {business.name}. By using the website you agree to them.</p>

  <h2>Who the website is for</h2>
  <p>This website provides general information for healthcare professionals, clinical teams and institutional buyers about the specialist products Neovantis supplies, and a way to send professional supply enquiries. It is not intended for patients or the general public, and it is not an online shop.</p>

  <h2>Information on the website</h2>
  <p>We aim to keep the information on this website accurate and current, but it is provided for general information only. Product descriptions are summaries. Specifications, availability and supply arrangements are confirmed with our team for each enquiry. Nothing on this website is an offer to sell or a guarantee of availability.</p>
  <p>Product images on this website show general product types and may not depict specific Neovantis products.</p>

  <h2>Enquiries</h2>
  <p>Sending an enquiry does not create an order or a contract. Any supply is subject to confirmation by Neovantis and to the terms agreed at that time.</p>

  <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
  <p>The Neovantis name, logo and the content of this website belong to Neovantis or its licensors. You may view and print pages for your own professional use. You may not reproduce or republish the content for commercial purposes without our written permission. Third-party names and trademarks belong to their respective owners.</p>

  <h2>Links to other websites</h2>
  <p>Where we link to other websites, we do so for convenience. We are not responsible for their content.</p>

  <h2>Liability</h2>
  <p>To the extent permitted by law, Neovantis is not liable for any loss arising from use of, or reliance on, information on this website. This does not limit any rights you have under South African law that cannot be excluded.</p>

  <h2>Governing law</h2>
  <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the Republic of South Africa.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about these terms can be sent to <a href={`mailto:${business.email}`}>{business.email}</a>.</p>
</LegalLayout>
